<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-QUEENSLAND OPEN LEADING SECOND ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-QUEENSLAND OPEN LEADING SECOND ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE, Australia 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after</p>
<p>the second round of the Queensland Open at the par-72 Windaroo</p>
<p>Country Club course on Friday (Australian unless stated):</p>
